        <mxCell id="nosql-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Note for the panel: this is NoSQL, not a relational database&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#55697A&quot;&gt;Firestore stores collections of documents, so there are no foreign keys enforced by the database. The PK/FK labels above describe how the app&lt;br&gt;treats these id fields; the joins happen in JavaScript. One rule is enforced in code rather than by the database: one review per user per property.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#EEF4F7;strokeColor=#D5E3EA;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0D1B26;" vertex="1" parent="1">
